  {
   "say": "Fourteen kilometres of seafront. The best on Earth?",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "say": "Tel Aviv's promenade runs from Jaffa all the way north. Thirteen beaches on one walk.",
   "screen": "Tel Aviv: *14 km,* 13 beaches",
   "at": "L1",
   "until": "L1e"
  },
  {
   "say": "So let's race it against the world's famous seafronts. By length.",
   "screen": "Seafront promenades, by *length*",
   "at": "L2",
   "until": "L2e"
  },
  {
   "say": "Alexandria's Corniche: over sixteen kilometres. The Mediterranean champion."
  },
  {
   "say": "Then Tel Aviv, fourteen. Doha and Nice, about seven each."
  },
  {
   "say": "Bondi to Coogee, six. Beirut, almost five. Copacabana, four. Venice Beach, three."
  },
  {
   "say": "Tel Aviv takes silver. Not bad for a city of half a million."
  },
  {
   "say": "Now, how busy? Tel Aviv counts eight and a half million beach visits a year."
  },
  {
   "say": "Venice Beach says about ten million. The others publish no official count."
  },
  {
   "say": "And beauty? No ranking can measure that. So you decide.",
   "screen": "Beauty: *you* decide",
   "at": "L9:you",
   "until": "L9e"
  },
  {
   "say": "Nice at sunset?"
  },
  {
   "say": "Copacabana's famous waves?"
  },
  {
   "say": "Beirut from the sea?"
  },
  {
   "say": "Or Tel Aviv, beach after beach?"
  },
  {
   "say": "Which one would you walk?",
   "screen": "Which one would *you* walk?",
   "at": "L14",
   "until": "L15"
  },
  {
